  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beneath thick white cloud soil lies a boundless ocean holding three enormous continents with dense forests, steep mountains, vast prairies, and foggy swamps.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Northern Plains region field because Lang Ya blessed land is already seated that way from northern plains riddle craze context. Chapter 882 does not name a five-region seat for what lies under the cloud soil.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the last cloud buildings fall and twelve wave cloud confusion formation breaks, the field shows pure white sky and white cloud soil ground. Qin Bai Sheng grabs at the sky; a mysterious black robed Gu Immortal and Fairy Jiang Yu grab at the cloud soil. A giant crack then runs east to west through the thick cloud soil. Fang Yuan sees the true Lang Ya blessed land under that surface and treats everything he had seen before as only the surface set up.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-soil-broken-open",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Below the crack lies a boundless ocean holding three enormous continents with dense forests, steep mountains, vast prairies, and foggy swamps. Living beings fill sky, ocean, and earth in a food chain on those continents, and hairy men alone rule there, with villages and cities across mountains, prairies, and river banks, and with explorers among ocean islands. Mo Tan Sang realizes the standing ground until then was only the blessed land’s sky clouds; Hei Cheng and Fang Yuan both mark the space as far beyond ordinary blessed lands and most grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        882
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "interior-geography",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_tan_sang",
        "char_hei_cheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Immortal Gu is taken away, Lang Ya blessed land shakes, huge waves crash into the three continents, and the endless hairy men living there face severe threat.",
      "chapters": [
        884
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
